<title>GREECE: ATHENS BANKS BUY 120-160 MLN ECUS AT FIX, ECU/DRS UP.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BANKS BUY 120-160 MLN ECUS AT FIX, ECU/DRS UP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens-based banks bought 120 to 160 million ecus for drachmas at Friday's fixing and ecu/drachma broke out of the 304 on the upside subsequently in active trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>Ecu/drachma ended at 303.85 at the fixing from 303.740 on Thursday. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
